---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Curated Watchlists & OTT Guides"
seo_title: "Curated Watchlists & Weekly OTT Guides | Moview"
seo_description: "Editorial watchlists rounding up the best new OTT releases, genre essentials, and Hindi web series worth your weekend."
permalink: /lists/index.html
breadcrumbs:
  - name: "Home"
    url: "/"
  - name: "Lists"
    url: "/lists/"
---

<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:py-14">
  <header class="border-b border-white/10 pb-8">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#F5F5F5] sm:text-4xl">
      Curated Lists
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 sm:text-base">
      Hand-picked OTT roundups and themed recommendations across Hindi movies and web series.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
    {% for list in collections.lists %}
      <article class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-[#181A20] p-6 transition-colors hover:border-white/25">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400">
            <time datetime="{{ list.date | isoDate }}">{{ list.date | readableDate }}</time>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
            <span class="tabular-nums">{{ list.data.items.length }} titles</span>
          </p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-[#F5F5F5]">
            <a href="{{ list.url }}" class="hover:text-[#E50914]">{{ list.data.title }}</a>
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
            {{ list.data.intro }}
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10">
          <a href="{{ list.url }}" class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#E50914] hover:underline underline-offset-4">
            Open watchlist &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
